        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) The holiday period shall be the twenty-four (24) consecutive hour period between midnight and midnight on the calendar day on which the holiday is observed. For those tours which cross midnight, the holiday period shall be the twenty-four (24) consecutive hour period beginning with the scheduled start of the tour that commences on the calendar day on which an authorized holiday is observed. This may be changed by mutual agreement between the local Union and local Management to such twenty-four (24) consecutive hour period that commences on the eve of the calendar day on which an authorized holiday is observed (calendar day preceding such holiday observance day).",
